      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
